OL,4,CBoy, 7, pulled alive from rubble hours 
OL,5,Cafter Russian strike on Ukraine,       
OL,6,Crescuers say                           
OL,7,GA seven-year-old boy has been rescued  
OL,8,Gfrom the rubble of a residential       
OL,9,Gbuilding in Dymer, in the Kyiv region, 
OL,10,Gafter 14 hours. Overnight Russian      
OL,11,Gstrikes on the village killed 11       
OL,12,Gpeople, Ukrainian officials have said. 
OL,14,FThe attack occurred in the early hours 
OL,15,Fof Sunday. A 79-year-old woman was     
OL,16,Falso rescued alive from the collapsed  
OL,17,Fbuilding, Kyiv's regional head Tymur   
OL,18,FTkachenko said.                        
OL,20,FA strike on a private home in Bila     
OL,21,FTserkva killed one more person and set 
OL,22,Fthe building ablaze, he added.         
